                                       <h1 style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 30px;"><strong>How to download your NISM Series V-A Study Material?</strong></h1>

                                        <p class="about-text" style="color:#000; text-align:justify; margin-top:15px;">
Once you register for the NISM Series V-A Mutual Fund Distributors Certification Exam, accessing the official study material becomes your next priority.
<br><br>
The study material provided by National Institute of Securities Markets is the most important resource for exam preparation, as it covers the complete syllabus and is directly aligned with the exam pattern defined under Securities and Exchange Board of India regulations.
<br><br>
Candidates can easily download both the study material and admit card from the NISM candidate dashboard. Below are the exact steps you need to follow.
</p>


<h2 class="mt-5" style="color:#0d47a1; font-size:28px;">Steps to Download the NISM Series V-A Study Material</h2>

<!-- Infographic -->
<div style="text-align:center; margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:25px;">
    <img src="../../images/HowTo/Download the NISM Series V-A Study Material.png"
         alt="Download the NISM Series V-A Study Material Infographic"
         style="max-width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
</div>


<div style="background-color:#e3f2fd; border-left:6px solid #0d47a1; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; margin-top:15px;">
<p style="margin:0; color:#000;"><strong>Workbook Download Process</strong></p>
</div>

<ul style="list-style:none; padding-left:0; color:#000; margin-top:15px;">
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Visit the official website of the National Institute of Securities Markets.</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Navigate to the <strong>Certification</strong> section.</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Log in to the NISM certification portal using your candidate credentials.</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Open the <strong>Candidate Dashboard.</strong></li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Locate the section for <strong>Study Material / Workbooks / Downloads.</strong></li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Search for <strong>“Mutual Fund Distributors Certification – Series V-A Workbook.”</strong></li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Click the <strong>Download</strong> option next to the workbook.</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> The study material will be available in PDF format.</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Download and save the file for offline study.</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> You can read it digitally or print the workbook for easier preparation.</li>
</ul>


<h2 style="font-size:28px; color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">
Important Notes
</h2>

<ul style="list-style:none; padding-left:0; color:#000; margin-top:10px;">
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Ensure your login credentials are correct before accessing the dashboard</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Verify that you are downloading the correct Series V-A workbook</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Keep both soft and printed copies for convenient access</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Use the latest available version of the workbook for updated syllabus coverage</li>
</ul>

<h2 style="font-size:28px; color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">
Conclusion
</h2>

<p class="about-text" style="color:#000; text-align:justify; margin-top:10px;">
Downloading your NISM Series V-A study material is a simple process when you follow the correct steps through the official portal of the National Institute of Securities Markets. Once downloaded, focus on using the workbook effectively, making short notes, and practising mock tests regularly to improve your chances of clearing the exam on the first attempt.
</p>
                                    
